' threads the O1-optimality upgrade; the seven family arms feed the abstract finite-trace
' lift (T21) to give the sound-baseline capstone (T22); T23 composes them over optimal
' matching. Every node is machine-checked (doc 22 section 9).
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName monospaced
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
